# The vendored model schemas are kept byte for byte as the Flowable engine publishes them — that
# identity is their provenance record, and it is what THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md claims about them. Several
# arrive with CRLF line endings, so line-ending normalisation is off for them: a normalised copy is no
# longer the file anyone can diff against the published one.
idea-plugin/src/main/resources/schemas/** -text
